@startuml
title Bunny Code - System Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor "User" as User

node "Browser" as Browser {
  component "Vue Frontend App\n- Login & JWT\n- Projects & Versions\n- Workspace Editor\n- Playback View\n- Battle View" as Frontend
}

cloud "CDN Distribution\n(CloudFront-style)" as CDN
node "Object Storage\n(S3-compatible)" as S3

node "Nginx Reverse Proxy" as Nginx

node "Backend\nNode.js/Express + Socket.IO" as Backend {
  package "REST APIs" {
    component "Authentication API\n(JWT issue/validate)" as AuthAPI
    component "Project API" as ProjectAPI
    component "Version API\n(Initial Files)" as VersionAPI
    component "Code Execution API" as ExecAPI
    component "Playback API" as PlaybackAPI
    component "File Upload API" as UploadAPI
  }
  package "Real-time Sockets" {
    component "Workspace Namespace\n- Authorization statusChecked\n- Edit state & occupation\n- Leave & disconnect cleanup" as WorkspaceSock
    component "Battle Namespace\n- Invite & accept (atomic)\n- Readiness & code sync\n- Compile/Judge\n- Outcome & leave" as BattleSock
  }
}

database "MySQL\n(Relational: users, projects,\nversions, battles, ...)" as MySQL
database "InfluxDB\n(Time-series: coding-process records)" as InfluxDB
node "Redis\n(Cache: workspace map,\ninvitation & battle state)" as Redis
node "Docker Sandbox\n(Compile/Execute Code)" as Sandbox
node "CI/CD & Automated Deployment" as CICD

User --> Frontend : UI interaction

Frontend --> CDN : GET static assets & archives
S3 --> CDN : Origin for distribution

Frontend --> Nginx : REST APIs (HTTPS)
Frontend --> Nginx : Socket.IO (WebSocket)

Nginx --> AuthAPI
Nginx --> ProjectAPI
Nginx --> VersionAPI
Nginx --> ExecAPI
Nginx --> PlaybackAPI
Nginx --> UploadAPI
Nginx --> WorkspaceSock
Nginx --> BattleSock

AuthAPI --> MySQL : Users, credentials
ProjectAPI --> MySQL : Projects CRUD
VersionAPI --> MySQL : Versions & initial files metadata

WorkspaceSock --> MySQL : Project/version access check
WorkspaceSock --> Redis : Socket<->workspace mapping
WorkspaceSock --> InfluxDB : Write coding events

PlaybackAPI --> InfluxDB : Query playback by project/version/time

ExecAPI --> Sandbox : Submit code to compile/execute
Sandbox --> ExecAPI : Execution result (status/output/errors)

BattleSock --> Redis : Temp invitations (WATCH)\nState updates (readiness, code)
BattleSock --> MySQL : Create battle & outcomes
BattleSock --> Sandbox : Compile & judge

UploadAPI --> S3 : Upload code/user/battle files
S3 --> UploadAPI : Metadata & distributable URL

AuthAPI --> Frontend : JWT/user details or errors
ProjectAPI --> Frontend : Project results
VersionAPI --> Frontend : Version & initial files
ExecAPI --> Frontend : Execution result
PlaybackAPI --> Frontend : Playback data
UploadAPI --> Frontend : Distributable file URLs
WorkspaceSock --> Frontend : statusChecked & workspace events
BattleSock --> Frontend : Battle events

CICD --> Frontend : Deploy SPA build to S3/CDN
CICD --> Backend : Deploy Node/Express & Socket.IO
CICD --> Nginx : Deploy reverse-proxy config
CICD --> Redis : Configure connectivity
CICD --> MySQL : Schema/init
CICD --> InfluxDB : Retention/policies
CICD --> Sandbox : Build images/config
CICD --> S3 : Buckets & distribution

note right of Redis
- Verify readiness before cache ops (NFR-002)
- Isolated execution & WATCH for acceptance\n(NFR-001, C-006)
- Stores: socket/version mappings,\n  temp invitations, battle state
end note

note right of Sandbox
All code execution runs in Docker\n(NFR-005, C-009)
end note

note bottom of AuthAPI
Reject empty/malformed JWT (FR-003)\nReturn user info on valid JWT (FR-002)
end note

note top of WorkspaceSock
Default readOnly=true & authorization=false\nwhen project/version missing (FR-008)\nPersist mapping only when authorized\nand Redis is ready (FR-009)
end note

note top of CDN
Distribute static assets and archives (FR-018)
end note
@enduml
